              ***The Shadow's EdGe Random Start Screen V1.0***
                     Written fo CNet Version 3.0 & 3.05
              May Work With other versions... Not yet tested

		            ***Introduction***

	This is an extremely simple program that will display Random screens
in place of The sys.start screen.  I wrote this for My CNet BBs because I had 
a few screens I was debating between using for My sys.start, and then figured 
it would be cool to use them all randomly.


		 	    ***Installation***

	First copy the Start directory to Systext/.  Then copy all the screens
you want the program to use to this directory, and rename them start.1,
start.2, etc... untill you get to the last screen.  Then load the RanStart
program into an editor and change the "MAX=" Variable to the highest Number
screen you have, (i.e., if the highest screen is start.5, then MAX=5).  Then 
use the File Included for your Sys.Start file, and your set to go!


